NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixCompleteEvent kind=const
  digest=b3:f3bc720663c1fd36f629543b84df7db1a88cdef3cbeea126d6b9865368d1ce00 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=786:792 lang=go exported=false byte_range=33320:33819
  sig=untyped string
  doc=automatrixCompleteEvent is the broker event type announcing that Neo finished\nan unprompted opportunity (req 6.1). It carries the RESULT, not the protocol\n(no Chronos/alarm/marker/cortex jargon — the consumer rule, req 6.5): the\nopportunity summary, a result summary, the conversation it belongs to, the\ncreated_at, the unread flag, and the durable record id. The client renders it\nas an Automatrix inbox item / unread badge.
