NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter kind=type
  digest=b3:465a17d8ad0b523ced8364c815da6088084b91f34a9e312cb2af87ce0a36d53b file=neo/internal/server/session.go range=1109:1122 lang=go exported=false byte_range=45753:46603
  sig=type automatrixReporter struct {\n	mu	sync.Mutex\n	result	string\n}
  doc=automatrixReporter is the QUIET reporter for an autonomous Automatrix run. It\nsurfaces NOTHING to the user (req 5.5: a proactive run has no live SSE/thread\npresence — the surprise result is delivered out of band by the completion\npath, task 5.3) but CAPTURES the agent's final user-facing answer so that\npath can use it as the result-not-protocol summary of what Neo produced. Only\nthe latest Say text is retained; on a genuine gate-passed completion that is\nthe finished result, and on a partial/ceiling terminal the captured text is\nnever used (settle announces nothing). Guarded by a mutex because the\nsupervisor may rebuild the agent (and thus Say from a fresh attempt) while\nthe runner goroutine reads the captured result after the run returns.
EDGES
  contains=matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter#mu,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter#result,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.Delta,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.Notice,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.Progress,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.Say,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.Status,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.Think,matrix/neo/internal/server.automatrixReporter.lastResult
  implements=matrix/neo/internal/agent.Reporter
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/server/session.go

