NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.newDeathEntry kind=func
  digest=b3:558067b1a8341c904f44eaf1feed38c08aa24c0041b59094e8a2bfb4a867f4fb file=neo/internal/server/session.go range=701:717 lang=go exported=false byte_range=30003:30621
  sig=func newDeathEntry(objective string, attempt int, err error, class delegate.FailureClass, state string) deathEntry
  doc=newDeathEntry builds the shared death descriptor from one attempt's outcome.\nThe Digest is exactly the deathDigest(err) the successor's resume prime folds\nin; when that is empty (a non-ErrIncomplete death) it falls back to the\nfriendly error so the durable record is never blank.
