  sig=func newMCPAlarmController(tm *tools.Manager) *mcpAlarmController
  doc=newMCPAlarmController wraps the shared tool manager. A nil manager yields a\ncontroller whose calls error cleanly (the daemon logs and the opt-in fails\nclosed rather than silently pretending an alarm exists).
