NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/server.traceWorkspaceTypes kind=var
  digest=b3:7f939bedddaa87265e35ba9d24e6d436b0441bc1da84f7b0e9a59b1d9cf2a4a2 file=neo/internal/server/engine.go range=726:755 lang=go exported=false byte_range=30831:32220
  sig=map[string]bool
  doc=traceWorkspaceTypes is the set of event types that make up the durable "Neo's\nComputer" workspace timeline (F3). Only these are persisted to the sidecar\ntrace store; transient channels (chat.delta, chat.thinking), gate/ask control\nevents, and terminals are NOT — they are either re-derived on reopen or\nirrelevant to the rebuilt workspace. chat.assistant is handled specially in\nrecordTrace (only the non-final "thinking out loud" narration is persisted;\nthe final answer + bubbles come from the durable conversation store).
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/server/engine.go

